"Servin-ith is an Artonan Grand Senator; December 2040 is her second trip to Earth."
"She is a little tall, with long white hair, pink eyes and a blue line tattooed across her nose."
"She wears red embroidered in white and many delicate silver rings."
"She called the Submerger disaster our error, and says not all magic is for sharing with Avowed."
"She treasures her role as protector of non-wizards and wants peace under Triplanetary rule."
"Her seat is so popular that it survives setbacks."
"Stuart says she has poor vision about chaos, favoring present comfort over future survival."
"Her politics differ from those of Esh-erdi, Lind-otta and the art'h family."
"She treats Alden Thorn like a child and called Lute a bestower."
"After Graham's attack at the Christmas market she swiftly removed Bash-nor as ambassador."
